@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Project Lab";
}

<section class="bio-page" aria-label="Project and repository lab">
    <div class="landing-container">
        <div class="bio-shell">
            <section class="repo-lab">
                <div class="repo-lab-header">
                    <p class="bio-kicker">Project Lab</p>
                    <h1 class="bio-title">Explore live apps, codebases, and build paths.</h1>
                    <p>
                        A GitHub-style workspace for exploring live apps, source code, and build commands.
                        This page combines projects from public GitHub and local legacy codebases.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://github.com/idiehl" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View full GitHub profile</a>
                </div>

                <div class="repo-grid">
                    <article class="repo-card" id="pulsegen">
                        <div class="repo-card-head">
                            <h3>PulseGen</h3>
                            <span>Windows desktop alpha</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            A sound laboratory for building tones, moving sounds through 3D spaces,
                            and hearing how distance, motion, rooms, and surfaces change what reaches your ears.
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Create sounds or import recordings, then draw paths for sounds and listeners.</li>
                            <li>Explore echoes, edit a recording's tones and noise, and capture separate stereo takes.</li>
                            <li>Export WAV, AIFF, FLAC, MP3, Ogg Vorbis, and Opus.</li>
                            <li>Current release: 0.1.0-alpha.20 &middot; Windows 11 x64 &middot; Experimental alpha</li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="repo-actions">
                            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://github.com/idiehl/PulseGen/releases/download/v0.1.0-alpha.20/PulseGen-0.1.0-alpha.20-win-x64.zip">Download for Windows</a>
                            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/idiehl/PulseGen" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View code</a>
                            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/idiehl/PulseGen/releases/tag/v0.1.0-alpha.20" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Release notes</a>
                        </div>
                        <p>Extract the ZIP, then run <code>PulseGen.exe</code>. Headphones are recommended.</p>
                    </article>

                    <article class="repo-card" id="pulseforge" style="scroll-margin-top: 6rem;">
                        <div class="repo-card-head">
                            <h3>PulseForge</h3>
                            <span>Windows desktop alpha</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            A stereo output workstation for headphones and speakers, built as a companion to PulseGen.
                            Shape each channel independently and inspect sound with live waveform, spectrum, and phase displays.
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Twelve parametric EQ nodes per channel, high/low-pass filters, resonance damping, and stereo controls.</li>
                            <li>Guarded output boost with a linked limiter, portable output modes, and device-setting recall.</li>
                            <li>Stack: .NET 10, Avalonia, C++20 DSP, and WASAPI &middot; Windows 11 x64</li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="repo-actions">
                            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/idiehl/PulseForge" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View code</a>
                            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/idiehl/PulseForge/blob/main/docs/ALPHA-ACCEPTANCE.md" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Alpha acceptance status</a>
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            System-wide processing requires the developer test driver and a deliberately configured Windows test environment.
                            A production-signed installer is not available; see the acceptance status for verified behavior and remaining hardware checks.
                        </p>
                        <pre><code>git clone https://github.com/idiehl/PulseForge.git
cd PulseForge
./scripts/bootstrap.ps1
./scripts/build.ps1 -Configuration Release
./scripts/verify.ps1 -Configuration Release -NoBuild</code></pre>
                    </article>

                    <article class="repo-card">
                        <div class="repo-card-head">
                            <h3>Atlas Forge</h3>
                            <span>Local + hosted</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>UI Design Laboratory using Astro with Vue and React component ecosystems.</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Source: local legacy directory + project history in site_repo</li>
                            <li>Live: <a href="https://forge.atlasuniversalis.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">forge.atlasuniversalis.com</a></li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="repo-actions">
                            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/idiehl/site_repo" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View code</a>
                        </div>
                        <pre><code>cd atlasforge
npm install
npm run dev</code></pre>
                    </article>

                    <article class="repo-card">
                        <div class="repo-card-head">
                            <h3>Atlas Meridian</h3>
                            <span>Local desktop app</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>Desktop visual workspace for mapping systems and ideas with nodes, frames, and rich content.</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Source: local legacy meridian solution (Atlas.Meridian.sln)</li>
                            <li>Stack: .NET 10 + Avalonia</li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="repo-actions">
                            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/idiehl/site_repo" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View code base</a>
                        </div>
                        <pre><code>cd meridian
dotnet restore Atlas.Meridian.sln
dotnet run --project src/Atlas.Universalis.App</code></pre>
                    </article>

                    <article class="repo-card">
                        <div class="repo-card-head">
                            <h3>Atlas Apply</h3>
                            <span>Live production app</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>AI-powered job application platform with tracking, profile tooling, and workflow automation.</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Source: <a href="https://github.com/idiehl/site_repo" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">github.com/idiehl/site_repo</a></li>
                            <li>Live: <a href="https://apply.atlasuniversalis.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">apply.atlasuniversalis.com</a></li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="repo-actions">
                            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/idiehl/site_repo" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View code</a>
                            <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://apply.atlasuniversalis.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Launch app</a>
                        </div>
                        <pre><code>pip install -r requirements.txt
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev</code></pre>
                    </article>

                    <article class="repo-card">
                        <div class="repo-card-head">
                            <h3>Enterprise and infrastructure work</h3>
                            <span>Platform scope</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>
                            Multi-application delivery across main site, app subdomains, deployment automation, CI/CD,
                            and production operations.
                        </p>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Includes architecture, deployment scripts, and production runbooks</li>
                            <li>Primary source: <a href="https://github.com/idiehl/site_repo" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">site_repo</a></li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="repo-actions">
                            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/idiehl/site_repo" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Explore repository</a>
                        </div>
                    </article>

                    <article class="repo-card">
                        <div class="repo-card-head">
                            <h3>Additional GitHub projects</h3>
                            <span>Public repos</span>
                        </div>
                        <p>Selected public repositories from GitHub for direct code access.</p>
                        <ul>
                            <li><a href="https://github.com/idiehl/Atlas_Battlegrounds" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Atlas_Battlegrounds</a></li>
                            <li><a href="https://github.com/idiehl/HYPERDESK" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">HYPERDESK</a></li>
                            <li><a href="https://github.com/idiehl/stockview" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">stockview</a></li>
                            <li><a href="https://github.com/idiehl/Cs_Type_Browser" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Cs_Type_Browser</a></li>
                            <li><a href="https://github.com/idiehl/tiny_api" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">tiny_api</a></li>
                            <li><a href="https://github.com/idiehl/wpf_samples" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">wpf_samples</a></li>
                        </ul>
                        <div class="repo-actions">
                            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/idiehl?tab=repositories" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Browse all repos</a>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </section>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
